Harmony independent balance extraction and recomputation

Files derived from harmony-migration, including the cutoff manifest, are
licensed under LGPL-3.0; see LICENSE.

The extractor does not import Harmony, go-ethereum, or migration-pipeline code.
It independently implements the Harmony-compatible RLP, state-trie and receipt
formats. Runtime dependencies are GoLevelDB and golang.org/x/crypto (Keccak),
plus their indirect dependencies, under their respective licenses.

The manifest's source_dependencies section records the reference migration
pipeline's environment for comparison; it is not this project's build recipe.
This project's actual Go dependencies are pinned in extractor/go.mod and go.sum.
